OL,3,GNEWSAGolf club 'heartbroken' after
OL,4,Athieves steal entire trophy collection
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the club said it had
OL,7,Faround 60 pieces of silverware in its
OL,8,Fcollection, including trophies with
OL,9,F"great sentimental value" that are no
OL,10,Flonger played for.
